eed not mention. P0157? Could keep as background? Maybe not necessary. But if original U2 supporting includes P0157, we can keep if it supports drug exposure? Let's inspect P0157 material: source_materials[19] study_summary: review on overcoming resistance, key findings categories resistance; not explicit antibiotics/PPIs. It may mention microbiota modulation as strategy. The original contribution says \"汇总抗生素、PPIs及类固醇暴露对ICI预后的负面效应量\" but not supported by given excerpt. Could be inaccurate. Better remove P0157 from U2 if not needed. But it is in chapter source_handles; can be unused. The instruction says don't return source_handle without substantive material. But if in supporting_studies, need substantive. We can omit. Not required to use all. But preserve evidence? Hmm. Could keep P0157 as \"broad resistance framework\" but not central. But U2 is drug exposures; P0157 not good. Remove.\n\nNeed maybe include P0548? Original U2 supporting includes P0548: integrates multi-scale evidence antibiotic effects heterogeneity. It is a review; can support caution. Keep maybe. P0548 in source_materials[28] says microbiota effect, antibiotics negative, heterogeneity. Good.\n\nNeed include P0123, P0033, P0289 for microbiome changes. P0236, P0266, P0275, P0339, P0360, P0517, P0081, P0402. P0402 is review; okay. P0081 meta. Need maybe P0157 removed, P0421 removed, P0576 removed.\n\nNeed ensure no source handle not in identity map. P0402 is in source_handles and source_materials[5], yes. P0585 in source_materials[3]. P0478. Good.\n\nNeed maybe update chapter-level thesis? The original thesis includes \"Phase III RCT 证据完全缺失\" and \"安全性信号受 ICI 方案严格调节\" which belongs U4? But Ch1 scope includes evidence ladder? Coordinated scope says excludes interventional trials (Ch5) but purpose includes distinguish evidence ladder. However U4 readonly handles evidence ladder. Chapter thesis includes intervention concepts and safety signals, maybe beyond U1/U2? But updated_plan complete for modifia